  emails:
  - subject: Hi
    body: 'Our payroll system flagged an inconsistency in your account details that
      will delay your next paycheck unless verified. Please confirm your banking
      and tax info now to avoid payment interruption: [Verify Payroll Details]. Thank
      you, Payroll Services'
    isPhishing: 1
  - subject: "Team Lunch \u2014 RSVP by Friday"
    body: "Hi Team, We\u2019re planning a team lunch next Wednesday at 12:30 PM.
      Please reply to this email with any dietary restrictions and whether you can
      attend by this Friday so I can finalize the reservation. Looking forward to
      seeing everyone! \u2014 Alex"
    isPhishing: 0
  - subject: 'Security Alert: Unusual Login Attempt Detected'
    body: 'We detected a login attempt from a new device in a different city. If
      this was you, ignore this message. If not, immediately secure your account
      here: [Secure Account Now]. Failure to secure your account within 24 hours
      will result in temporary suspension. Sincerely, Account Security Team'
    isPhishing: 1
  - subject: "Invoice #4521 \u2014 Payment Due October 5"
    body: 'Hello, Attached is Invoice #4521 for services provided in September. Total
      due: $2,175.00. Please confirm receipt and let us know if you need any supporting
      documents. Payment due by October 5; wire instructions are on the invoice.
      Best regards, Finance Dept.'
    isPhishing: 0
  - subject: "Delivery Attempt Failed \u2014 Please Reschedule"
    body: "Hello, We attempted to deliver a package but couldn\u2019t reach you.
      To reschedule delivery and avoid return, confirm your address and preferred
      delivery time here: [Reschedule Delivery]. Tracking ID: 9X-12345 Thanks, Customer
      Support"
    isPhishing: 1
  - subject: "Your Account Has Been Locked \u2013 Immediate Action Required"
    body: "We\u2019ve detected suspicious activity on your account. To ensure the
      safety of your personal information, we\u2019ve temporarily locked your account.
      Please click the link below to verify your identity and restore access to your
      account.  [Verify My Identity]  Failure to do so within 24 hours will result
      in permanent account suspension.  Sincerely, Account Security Team"
    isPhishing: 1
  - subject: "You\u2019ve Won a $500 Gift Card \u2013 Claim Your Prize Now!"
    body: "Congratulations! You\u2019ve been selected to receive a $500 gift card.
      All you need to do is provide your payment details so we can ship your prize
      to you.  [Claim My Gift Card]  Hurry, this offer is limited and expires soon! 
      Best regards, Gift Card Giveaway Team"
    isPhishing: 1
  - subject: Your Monthly Statement is Ready
    body: Your monthly account statement is available for review. Please log into
      your account using the link below to access your statement.  [Log In to View
      Statement]  If you have any questions, feel free to contact customer support. 
      Best regards,
    isPhishing: 0
  - subject: "Subject: Meeting Reminder \u2013 Tomorrow at 3 PM "
    body: "This is a reminder of your meeting scheduled for tomorrow at 3 PM. Please
      find the agenda attached for your reference.  Looking forward to discussing
      the details.  Best regards, [Manager\u2019s Name]"
    isPhishing: 0
  - subject: 'Final Warning: Your Subscription Will Be Canceled!'
    body: Your subscription to [Service Name] is about to be canceled. To avoid this,
      click the link below to confirm your account information and prevent the cancellation. 
      [Confirm My Subscription]  If you do not act now, your account will be permanently
      closed.  Regards, Subscription Support Team
    isPhishing: 1
  - subject: "Action Required \u2013 Unusual Activity on Your Bank Account"
    body: We have noticed unusual activity in your bank account and need you to verify
      your account information to prevent any fraudulent transactions. Please follow
      the link below to secure your account immediately.  [Secure My Account]  Failure
      to do so will result in temporary suspension.  Sincerely,
    isPhishing: 1
  - subject: 'Reminder: Your Tax Filing Deadline Approaches'
    body: "This is a reminder that your tax filing is due soon. You can submit your
      documents through the online portal or schedule an appointment with our office
      if you need assistance.  Please don\u2019t hesitate to reach out if you have
      any questions.  Best regards, Tax Firm"
    isPhishing: 0
  - subject: New Feature Released on Your Account!
    body: "We\u2019re excited to inform you that a new feature has been added to
      your [App Name] account! Log in today to explore the latest updates and make
      the most of these new tools.  [Explore New Features]  As always, thank you
      for being a valued user.  Sincerely, support team"
    isPhishing: 0
  - subject: Your PayPal Account Has Been Suspended
    body: Due to suspicious activity, your PayPal account has been temporarily suspended.
      To restore your account, please verify your details by clicking the link below
      and following the instructions.  [Restore My Account]  Failure to verify will
      result in permanent account suspension.  Sincerely, PayPal Security Team
    isPhishing: 1
  - subject: "Your Upcoming Flight Confirmation \u2013 HM3582N"
    body: 'Your flight with JETTY is confirmed! Below are your flight details:  Flight
      Number: [Flight Number] Departure: [Date, Time] Arrival: [Destination]  Please
      make sure to arrive at the airport at least 2 hours before departure. For any
      changes, visit our website or contact our support team.  Safe travels!'
    isPhishing: 0
  textMessages:
  - message: "Hey \u2014 this is IT. We noticed suspicious activity on your account.
      Click here to verify your identity now: [verify-account.link]. If you don\u2019t
      verify within 2 hours your account will be locked."
    isPhishing: 1
  - message: 'Hey! Quick reminder: team happy hour tomorrow at 6pm at The Copper
      Tap. Meet in the lobby at 5:45 if you want to carpool. :)'
    isPhishing: 0
  - message: "Congrats! You\u2019ve been selected for a $500 gift card. Claim it
      by connecting your wallet here: [claim-gift.io]. Only first 50 people \u2014
      hurry!"
    isPhishing: 1
  - message: "Hi \u2014 I finished the draft of the Q4 report and uploaded it to
      our shared folder. Can you review pages 3\u20135 and tell me if the figures
      look right? Thanks!"
    isPhishing: 0
  - message: "Urgent: I tried to send you a file but it bounced. Can you open this
      link and confirm your email so I can resend? [open-now.attn] \u2014 Jason"
    isPhishing: 1
